# What not to upload to Cloud Build.
#
# target/ is several gigabytes of build output that the builder rebuilds anyway.
# Sending it turns a thirty-second upload into a very long one.
#
# vendor/ stays. It is only a couple of megabytes and it holds the patched quinn
# the workspace depends on by path, so a build without it fails to resolve.
.git
.gitignore
target
fuzz/target
LICENSES
**/*.profraw
